## Helper catalog (`helpers/`)

Every helper takes `ui = { page, rec }` first and moves the cursor through `rec`.

| Helper                          | Module    | What it does                                       |
| ------------------------------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| `openLogin(ui)`                 | `auth.ts` | Opens the login page and waits for it              |
| `login(ui, username, password)` | `auth.ts` | Signs in and waits to leave the login page         |

## Step catalog (`steps/`)

Every step also takes `{ id?, title?, note?, transition? }`.

| Step    | Options                                           | Starts → ends                                      |
| ------- | ------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| `login` | `username?`, `password?` (default `APP_*`)        | As first step it opens the login page → signed in  |
| `hold`  | `ms?`                                             | Holds the screen (closing shot); skipped in tests  |

